Note that this code assumes that the "example-model" SageMaker model has already been created and is available in the same AWS region as the SageMaker endpoint. If the model is not available in the same region, you will need to specify the region where the model is located in the "model_name" attribute of the "aws_sagemaker_endpoint" resource.

Also, note that this code does not create any IAM roles or policies. If you need to create IAM roles or policies for the SageMaker endpoint, you will need to add additional Terraform code to create those resources.

