  Here is a description of the Terraform program I will define:

This Terraform program will create an autograder infrastructure for a CS class using AWS services. It will create an S3 bucket to store students' code, an AWS CodeBuild project to run the code, and an IAM role to grant CodeBuild access to the S3 bucket.

Here is the Terraform HCL program:
```
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

resource "aws_s3_bucket" "code_bucket" {
  bucket = "cs-autograder-code-bucket"
  acl    = "private"
}

resource "aws_codebuild_project" "autograder" {
  name          = "cs-autograder"
  description   = "Autograder for CS class"
  service_role  = aws_iam_role.codebuild_role.arn

  artifacts {
    type = "CODEPIPELINE"
  }

  environment {
    compute_type = "BUILD_GENERAL1_SMALL"
    image        = "aws/codebuild/standard:4.0"
    type         = "LINUX_CONTAINER"
  }

  source {
    type      = "GITHUB"
    location  = "https://github.com/<username>/<repository>"
    buildspec = "buildspec.yml"
  }
}

resource "aws_iam_role" "codebuild_role" {
  name = "cs-autograder-codebuild-role"

  assume_role_policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action = "sts:AssumeRole"
        Effect = "Allow"
        Principal = {
          Service = "codebuild.amazonaws.com"
        }
      },
    ]
  })
}

resource "aws_iam_role_policy" "codebuild_policy" {
  name = "cs-autograder-codebuild-policy"
  role = aws_iam_role.codebuild_role.id

  policy = jsonencode({
    Version = "2012-10-17"
    Statement = [
      {
        Action   = "s3:*"
        Effect   = "Allow"
        Resource = aws_s3_bucket.code_bucket.arn
      },
    ]
  })
}
```
This Terraform program defines the following resources:

* An S3 bucket named "cs-autograder-code-bucket" to store students' code.
* An AWS CodeBuild project named "cs-autograder" to run the code.
* An IAM role named "cs-autograder-codebuild-role" to grant CodeBuild access to the S3 bucket.
* An IAM role policy named "cs-autograder-codebuild-policy" to grant CodeBuild access to the S3 bucket.

