Note that this script assumes that you have already created the VPC and subnets in your AWS account. You will need to replace the `vpc_id` and `subnets` variables with the actual IDs of your VPC and subnets. Additionally, you will need to replace the `my-bucket` and `my-lb-logs` variables with the actual name of your S3 bucket and the prefix you want to use for your access logs.

